  "limitations": [
    "There are no existing user installations; retained stacks are QA fixtures.",
    "The online case uses a separate temporary loopback TLS server with the retained QA certificate/key. Application services remain stopped and the original lifecycle marker remains retained.",
    "TLS observation does not establish application health, revocation status, future trust, capacity or permission to start.",
    "This direct-certificate comparison expects the endpoint to present the installed leaf. A TLS-terminating proxy with a separate trusted certificate is reported as a mismatch.",
    "The default and server-only modes make no endpoint connection. Online mode is explicit and uses current Node trust without installing it.",
    "Unreachable or uncertain endpoints stay unverified; success never establishes complete installation readiness or a global writer fence.",
    "The 0.25 CPU limit applies only to observation helpers, not application workers.",
    "The frozen 0.1.0 artifact predates this source CLI increment.",
    "All qualification engines run on one physical Mac."
  ],
  "auditNote": "The first audit stopped on unclassified Compose version and container-inspect metadata calls. Their exact read-only forms were inspected and added to the auditor; the original failure log is retained alongside the passing final audit.",
